$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Tombaugh IV" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other for control of the bridge.  Holding the bridge is worth one point.  Each team must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base, touching it to their own flag for a point.  The flags are located atop a huge tower.  The first team with eight points shall be the victor!\n\n<f1>Map created by [HvC]NaTeDoGG\nhttp://havoc.sirris.com";